/Fontaine_74045/Q7405801","priority":5,"questId":74058,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":740580101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1400,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3339242154,"text":"Puca, we're back!","nextNodeIds":[740580102]},{"nodeId":740580102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5322,"speakerName":"Puca","textMapHash":593924250,"text":"#{NICKNAME} and Paimon! Are you here to play with me?","nextNodeIds":[740580103]},{"nodeId":740580103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1400,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3153553954,"text":"Um, not really! You told us that we could ask you anything related to ore veins and gemstones, right?","nextNodeIds":[740580104]},{"nodeId":740580104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5322,"speakerName":"Puca","textMapHash":3230409570,"text":"Yep! I've collected all the pretty stones around the area. What exactly do you wanna ask about?","nextNodeIds":[740580105]},{"nodeId":740580105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1400,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4039861946,"text":"It's about that stone we found last time...","nextNodeIds":[740580106]},{"nodeId":740580106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2773528994,"text":"You tell Puca about how you sold the strange ore to the gemstone merchant...","nextNodeIds":[740580107]},{"nodeId":740580107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5322,"speakerName":"Puca","textMapHash":600096458,"text":"Huh? People outside really thought that it was a precious gemstone? But I've even shown it to my sister before... Humans really are hard to understand...","nextNodeIds":[740580108]},{"nodeId":740580108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5322,"speakerName":"Puca","textMapHash":2798012306,"text":"But I know a lot of places with stones like this! If you want, I'll show you where they are.","nextNodeIds":[740580109]},{"nodeId":740580109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerNa